Third-party data and models are NOT covered by this license and remain under
their own terms:

- Bangla symptoms-disease dataset (data/raw/Symptoms.csv, assets/Symptoms.csv,
  assets/Symptom Arxiv.pdf): Zannat, Al Shafi & Muntakim, arXiv:2601.12068,
  published on Mendeley Data (doi:10.17632/rjgjh8hgrt.6) under its own license.
- Medicine list (assets/medicine.csv and derived files): Bangladesh DGDA registry data.
- Base models referenced or fine-tuned (sagorsarker/bangla-bert-base,
  asif00/whisper-bangla): see their Hugging Face model cards.
- Fonts used by the brand kit (Anek Bangla, Noto Sans Bengali, Inter):
  SIL Open Font License 1.1.

